$ colors --help
usage: colors  [--mesh value] [--cfl value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

Coloured output


Optional switches:
   [1m[36m--mesh[0m[0m value, [1m[36m-m[0m[0m value
    default value m.grd
    Mesh file
   [33m--cfl[0m value
    default value 0.5
    CFL number
   --help, -h
    Print this help message
   --markdown, -md
    Save this help message in a Markdown file
   --version, -v
    Print version
